From: Amperstrand <Amperstrand@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix: software iteration cap on wait loops + eh02 test repair

Semantic delta of fork commits e9ced1e + 1dd9f8d (history squashed: the
intermediate tree accidentally committed target/, which 1dd9f8d untracked).
Contains the src/ delta plus the 1dd9f8d .gitignore; the stray
src/comm/comm/ duplicate and the tracked Cargo.lock artifact are excluded
(neither belongs in an upstream submission).

Refreshed 2026-10-19 (#108): .gitignore folded in so this patch closes the
gap between the staged series and fork head — 0001+0002+0003 applied to an
empty tree now reproduces the 1dd9f8d tree exactly except the fork-side
Cargo.lock.

